      "title": "Constructor narrows existing ordinary Scheduler profile equivalence",
      "problem": "L1Exact.stringify(paired.profile) != L1Exact.stringify(canonical) rejects numeric type/representation differences that the unchanged old17 ordinary Scheduler deliberately accepts via Codec.same_values at threat_scheduler.gd1953. This happens in fresh candidate construction before original whole native validation and in _l1_binding_error, changing legacy acceptance semantics.",
